# data/history.csv is intentionally tracked (not ignored): it's the
# append-only daily price+score log the GitHub Actions pipeline commits to
# (.github/workflows/daily_pipeline.yml) — an ephemeral CI runner needs it
# committed to accumulate history across runs. Grows slowly (~80-90 rows/day).

